# {{.ProjectName}}

Ultra-fast, zero cold-start edge-native API built with **Hono** and **Cloudflare Workers**.

---

## ⚡ Tech Stack

- **Framework:** [Hono v4](https://hono.dev)
- **Runtime:** [Cloudflare Workers](https://workers.cloudflare.com)
- **Tooling:** [Wrangler CLI](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/wrangler/)
- **Language:** TypeScript 5.7+
- **Bindings:** Pre-configured for Environment Variables, KV Storage, and D1 Database

---

## 🚀 Getting Started

### 1. Install Dependencies
```bash
npm install
```

### 2. Run Local Development Server
```bash
npm run dev
```

Local server starts on [http://localhost:8787](http://localhost:8787).

---

## 🌐 API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/` | Edge greeting & Cloudflare data center (colo) info |
| `GET` | `/health` | Healthcheck and timestamp |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/geo` | Incoming client geo-location (Country, City, Region, ASN) |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/items` | List demo items |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/items` | Create a new demo item |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/items/:id` | Get item by ID |
| `DELETE` | `/api/v1/items/:id` | Delete item by ID |

---

## 🚀 Deploy to Cloudflare

Deploy globally to 300+ Cloudflare edge data centers in seconds:

```bash
# Log in to your Cloudflare account (first time)
npx wrangler login

# Deploy production worker
npm run deploy
```
